menu "NOTE4C firmware"

config NOTE4C_FAKE_DISPLAY
    bool "Use fake display backend"
    default y
    help
        Keep enabled for host-side and first-build validation. Disable only
        after backing up the device flash and confirming the NOTE4C label. The
        real backend is adapted from the NOTE4C four-color SSD2683 reference
        firmware. The black-and-white NOTE4 driver is never accepted here.

config NOTE4C_COLOR_TEST_PATTERN
    bool "Show the first-hardware-test color bars"
    default n
    depends on !NOTE4C_FAKE_DISPLAY
    help
        Render black, white, red, and yellow vertical bars and disable TODO
        interaction. Keep enabled for the first controlled NOTE4C display test.

endmenu
